1
00:00:39,936 --> 00:00:45,568
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:48,544
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:49,679 --> 00:00:51,200
Young Lord Zhu is getting married.

4
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:53,520
Someone's bound to be displeased.

5
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,840
In a few days,

6
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,119
we'll visit Lady Xingyao again.

7
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:56,928
Yes.

8
00:00:58,119 --> 00:00:58,640
Master,

9
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,640
Lady Xingyao and a young master
have come.

10
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,000
Show them in.

11
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,680
I am Wangyue.

12
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,640
And I am Xingyao.

13
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,040
- Greetings, Lord Censor.
- Greetings, Lord Censor.

14
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,040
Lady Xingyao, your leg

15
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:16,359
seems to have healed.

16
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,080
Yes.

17
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,640
Perhaps it's thanks to your medicine.

18
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:21,640
How did you two

19
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,560
deduce my identity?

20
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:25,400
The General's Manor
colluded with Prince Qi.

21
00:01:25,719 --> 00:01:27,599
The Merchant Coalition
secretly gathered evidence,

22
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:28,840
only to be wiped out suddenly.

23
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:31,359
They must have uncovered
something vital.

24
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:33,319
The Coalition was powerful,

25
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,239
with many informants.

26
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,519
To eliminate

27
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,799
their entire local presence

28
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:37,599
in a single blow

29
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,879
is no ordinary feat at all.

30
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,599
To provoke the mastermind

31
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:43,280
into taking such lethal measures,

32
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,200
the one directing the Coalition

33
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:47,680
must have direct access to the throne.

34
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,200
That leaves very few possibilities.

35
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:54,120
So, it was just a guess.

36
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:57,200
But what if you're wrong?

37
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,840
It wouldn't matter.

38
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:01,000
The Coalition probes the Yues,

39
00:02:01,359 --> 00:02:02,760
and you're their honored guest.

40
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,760
That makes you an enemy of the Yues.

41
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,680
The enemy of my enemy

42
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,159
is my friend.

43
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,439
Yesterday, you went

44
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:13,159
to visit my mother's old residence.

45
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:16,080
You must know something about our family

46
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,639
and wish to befriend us.

47
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,800
If we are friends,

48
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,599
Lady Wangshu,

49
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:22,000
why disguise yourself as a man

50
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,280
to deceive others?

51
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,400
Nothing escapes your eyes.

52
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,800
Since I've been investigating the Yues,

53
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,400
naturally, I've heard
about your grievances.

54
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:34,520
But given your character, Lady Wangshu,

55
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,759
I wouldn't get too close.

56
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,080
My character?

57
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,080
What do you mean?

58
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:40,960
Your cousin was betrothed

59
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,800
to Young Lord Zhu since childhood.

60
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:43,960
You came between them,

61
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,960
ignoring the sisterhood.

62
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,240
Now you blame the Yue family,

63
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,120
trying to use me
for your personal vendetta.

64
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,319
You claim you investigated.

65
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:55,759
Don't you know what Wangshu suffered

66
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:57,240
or why she must disguise

67
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,120
herself as a man

68
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,159
to avoid being seen?

69
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,439
With a decree,

70
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:02,360
His Majesty, Prince Qi,
and the Yue family

71
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,319
sent Wangshu off as a sacrifice!

72
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:06,159
As an official of the imperial court,

73
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,879
you slander her with such filthy words.

74
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,319
You completely distort the truth

75
00:03:11,319 --> 00:03:12,199
and are unprincipled!

76
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,439
Imperial Censor or not,

77
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:15,039
I wouldn't budge even for the Emperor!

78
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:34,960
Wangshu, let's go.

79
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:36,608
Wait.

80
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,960
I misspoke earlier.

81
00:03:39,159 --> 00:03:39,759
Forgive me.

82
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,680
I didn't mean it.

83
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,319
The sacrifice to the Loong Lord

84
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:44,719
was not by my...

85
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,400
by His Majesty's order.

86
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:47,800
Rather,

87
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:50,039
Prince Qi and the Yue family conspired,

88
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,199
forging the decree.

89
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,280
Is that true?

90
00:03:52,599 --> 00:03:53,400
Every word of it.

91
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,400
I only thought

92
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,280
what I am planning is monumental

93
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:58,360
and dangerous.

94
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,599
Having met you only a few times,

95
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,919
we're barely familiar.

96
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:05,919
So I wanted to provoke you

97
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:07,680
to see your true character.

98
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:11,199
But I truly crossed the line just now.

99
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,360
I apologize to you both.

100
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:15,919
I only hope you two

101
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:17,639
will do your best

102
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,480
to help me.

103
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:23,040
We only just agreed to meet you,

104
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,439
and we saved your life,

105
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,680
yet you say we're holding back?

106
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,920
Do our best?

107
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,439
You mean...

108
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:32,560
Lady Wangshu, I'm sure

109
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:33,920
you know what I mean.

110
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:38,639
We will uncover the truth
about the Yue family,

111
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,759
giving you the proof to take them down.

112
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:44,360
I only ask that you
introduce me to Master Lizhi.

113
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:44,959
Will you?

114
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:52,759
Lizhi?

115
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,519
Protect the master!

116
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:56,920
Master Lizhi.

117
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:57,959
Stand down.

118
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,519
Stand down.

119
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,959
I'm Wei Xun. Greetings, Master Lizhi.

120
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:03,839
You avoided me

121
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:05,360
and slipped out,

122
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,360
just to meet him?

123
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,800
Since you're here,

124
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,560
join us for tea.

125
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,360
No, he has things to do.

126
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,120
No, I don't.

127
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,160
Why are you sending me away?

128
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,399
Do you

129
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:19,120
want to be alone with him?

130
00:05:19,439 --> 00:05:20,032
I...

131
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,800
Since you're here,

132
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,839
join us, please.

133
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,839
So you're hiding something,

134
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:25,720
but you're showing it,

135
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,959
you fickle woman.

136
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,360
Where did you pick up such vile words?

137
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,839
If your conscience were clear,

138
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:32,959
why try to send me away?

139
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,240
Fine.

140
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:35,879
My conscience is guilty.

141
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,000
I look out for you,

142
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:37,959
and it makes me guilty?

143
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,560
Then stay here by yourself.

144
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,920
Go ahead and deal with

145
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,360
this Master Wei Xun,

146
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,240
who yearns for you
and buys you art books!

147
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:45,759
Xingyao, you're right.

148
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,839
Let's go.

149
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,519
Let this schemer

150
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,920
talk to this brainless fool all day!

151
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:51,872
Let's go.

152
00:05:57,199 --> 00:05:58,160
Did she just

153
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,040
insult both of us?

154
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,000
Why?

155
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:06,759
Wangshu,

156
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:08,000
well...

157
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,639
Are we really leaving him behind?

158
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,680
We'll go back in a bit.

159
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:21,160
That guard of the Loong Lord...

160
00:06:21,439 --> 00:06:22,720
how powerful is he really?

161
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,040
Why ask that out of the blue?

162
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,199
I just don't understand.

163
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:30,000
If he has such godlike powers,

164
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,279
why do we have to

165
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:33,040
be so secretive and tread so carefully?

166
00:06:34,199 --> 00:06:35,240
I feel

167
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,600
you're being far too cautious.

168
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:38,000
With his help,

169
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:40,519
taking down the Yues
would be effortless.

170
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:44,680
Fine.

171
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,519
I won't ask about what I shouldn't.

172
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,600
Xingyao.

173
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,759
Over there!

174
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,680
Let's go.

175
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,759
Master Lizhi.

176
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,360
What is a "brainless fool"?

177
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:16,279
A brainless fool is...

178
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:16,959
Master,

179
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,279
remember back at Chunfeng Pavilion?

180
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,000
Just because

181
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,560
Lady Wangshu spoke to you,
Master Lizhi was also...

182
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,879
Master Lizhi,

183
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,360
toward Lady Wangshu,

184
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,639
I harbor no illicit intentions

185
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:30,000
nor improper desires.

186
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,000
The one I desire

187
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:31,959
is you.

188
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,160
That's a brainless fool.

189
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,759
Long time no see,

190
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,040
my dear sisters.

191
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,839
(Hurry.)

192
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,120
(What does "hur" mean?)

193
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,360
Yue Qiyang!

194
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:20,879
Xingyao!

195
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:21,639
Xingyao!

196
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,480
Move!

197
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,800
Wangshu! Wangshu!

198
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:24,439
Xingyao!

199
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,839
Wangshu! Wangshu!

200
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:26,519
Yue Qiyang!

201
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:27,168
Wangshu!

202
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:46,600
Let me tell you,

203
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,000
the Loong Consort fled,

204
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,240
but she got caught?

205
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,759
Got caught?

206
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:52,559
Will the wedding still happen?

207
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:03,039
Yue Wangshu,

208
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:06,240
you really love
causing trouble for our family.

209
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,759
Eloping, fleeing...

210
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:11,879
It would've saved me the hassle

211
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,440
if you could stay hidden.

212
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:16,360
Out of sight, out of mind.

213
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:20,279
Yet you just had to

214
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:23,759
linger right under our noses.

215
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,120
Yue Qiyang,

216
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,840
drop the act.

217
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,600
For your precious ambitions,

218
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,360
no matter where I fled to,

219
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,759
you'd still hunt me down.

220
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:34,759
Don't think I don't know

221
00:09:35,799 --> 00:09:38,000
what you and Prince Qi are plotting.

222
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,480
Go on.

223
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,600
What else do you know?

224
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,000
What?

225
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,159
Are you scared?

226
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,200
Yue Wangshu,

227
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,960
sometimes I really can't tell

228
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:00,960
whether you're brilliant

229
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,080
or stupid.

230
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:05,720
You could've stayed hidden safely,

231
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:08,960
yet you insist on
scheming with your sister

232
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,480
to make trouble for our family.

233
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,360
Has Yue Xingyao's leg

234
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:16,000
healed?

235
00:10:16,639 --> 00:10:17,440
Indeed.

236
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,320
Good deeds bring good karma.

237
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,799
You aren't afraid to die,

238
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:27,840
nor do you care if she dies?

239
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,080
Didn't you arrange

240
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,440
a marriage for Xingyao?

241
00:10:32,759 --> 00:10:33,600
What?

242
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,919
Aren't you afraid
of answering to her in-laws?

243
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:40,759
Don't you know

244
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,399
that a runaway Loong Consort

245
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,360
must be

246
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,559
burned at the stake by law?

247
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:46,720
Do it.

248
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,200
If you dare,

249
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:50,240
I promise you

250
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,879
the one who regrets it

251
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:54,639
will be you.

252
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,720
If I feel like it,

253
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:02,200
I could find a scapegoat

254
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,399
or perhaps

255
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,240
let you die of illness in the cell

256
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:11,399
and send you far away.

257
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,480
That wouldn't be impossible.

258
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,519
My dear sister,

259
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,559
tell me,

260
00:11:16,799 --> 00:11:19,000
why is Zhu Heng

261
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:21,320
so obsessed with you

262
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:23,879
and completely infatuated?

263
00:11:24,159 --> 00:11:27,519
What makes you so special?

264
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:30,200
I'm truly curious.

265
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:40,000
Beg me.

266
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,960
If you're so eager to die,

267
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,759
I'll show you

268
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:53,399
what it feels like to beg for life,

269
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,440
only to find death is denied.

270
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,600
Master Lizhi, you...

271
00:12:06,679 --> 00:12:07,799
Yue Wangshu,

272
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:10,519
as a Loong Consort
sacrificed to the Loong Lord,

273
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,080
you fled without permission

274
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,159
to the mortal realm

275
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,919
and defied the divine.
Do you plead guilty?

276
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,240
I told you,

277
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,559
I didn't run away.

278
00:12:20,559 --> 00:12:23,240
The Loong Lord sent me back
to visit family.

279
00:12:24,399 --> 00:12:25,440
To visit family?

280
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,399
How accommodating of him.

281
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:30,399
Someone!

282
00:12:31,159 --> 00:12:31,799
Examine her!

283
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:32,960
Understood.

284
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:45,919
My Lord,

285
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,919
this woman is no longer a maiden.

286
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,600
Understood.

287
00:12:58,840 --> 00:12:59,919
Yue Wangshu,

288
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,840
you truly have no shame.

289
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:05,159
I am the Loong Consort
chosen by the Loong Lord.

290
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,759
Serving him

291
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:09,120
and receiving his favor

292
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:12,120
is entirely natural.

293
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,600
Yet you

294
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:15,480
preach reverence for the divine,

295
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,799
while serving the Loong Lord

296
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:20,679
was just a facade.

297
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:21,840
Shut up!

298
00:13:25,519 --> 00:13:26,080
Master?

299
00:13:26,279 --> 00:13:27,039
Are you alright?

300
00:13:30,399 --> 00:13:31,720
My Lord! My Lord!

301
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,080
The two ladies of Yue

302
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,600
were captured by Yue Qiyang!

303
00:13:43,679 --> 00:13:44,240
Wangshu!

304
00:13:45,039 --> 00:13:45,600
Stop!

305
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,559
Qiyang,

306
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:47,799
are you insane?

307
00:13:48,159 --> 00:13:49,200
I am insane?

308
00:13:49,679 --> 00:13:50,440
Young Lord,

309
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,279
don't forget

310
00:13:52,039 --> 00:13:54,440
today is your wedding day to Lingluo.

311
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,279
You abandoned all the guests

312
00:13:56,279 --> 00:13:57,440
and your bride

313
00:13:57,759 --> 00:13:59,639
to come to this filthy dungeon

314
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,759
just to defend this wretched woman?

315
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,320
Do you really think

316
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:07,080
she's still that pure,

317
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:10,240
spotless maiden

318
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:12,960
you imagined her to be?

319
00:14:13,639 --> 00:14:16,600
She didn't just escape.

320
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:21,080
She even slept with some other man.

321
00:14:25,879 --> 00:14:27,919
Wangshu, is what he said true?

322
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,440
Did you and he truly...

323
00:14:31,279 --> 00:14:32,080
Zhu Heng,

324
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:34,399
what's with that face?

325
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,159
Did you expect me

326
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,440
to remain chaste for you,

327
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,519
waiting until who knows when

328
00:14:41,399 --> 00:14:43,799
for you to take pity and save me?

329
00:14:51,679 --> 00:14:52,840
Look at you.

330
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:54,840
Even knowing she was unchaste,

331
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:58,240
you're still flattering yourself.

332
00:14:58,720 --> 00:14:59,960
Now I suspect

333
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,440
she's been colluding
with that outsider all along,

334
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,600
working from both sides.

335
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:05,039
I must interrogate her properly.

336
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,144
Report!

337
00:15:08,879 --> 00:15:11,440
My Lord, these two were guards
at the lake that day.

338
00:15:11,759 --> 00:15:12,480
They confessed

339
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,480
to taking bribes

340
00:15:13,679 --> 00:15:14,519
and clearing out

341
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:15,080
to let her go.

342
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,080
Take them away.

343
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,279
Yes. Take them away!

344
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:20,679
So, someone helped you escape.

345
00:15:22,039 --> 00:15:23,279
Who could it be?

346
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,000
Who was it?

347
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:29,840
Didn't the Loong Lord
send you to visit family?

348
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:33,279
Why not summon him here?

349
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:35,360
Wangshu, speak up.

350
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,840
Tell us!

351
00:15:37,159 --> 00:15:38,759
He put you through all this suffering.

352
00:15:38,759 --> 00:15:39,960
Why are you defending him?

353
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:40,799
Tell me,

354
00:15:41,799 --> 00:15:43,039
and I can help you.

355
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,240
In scheming against the Yues,

356
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:49,120
how deeply is your lover involved?

357
00:15:49,279 --> 00:15:50,080
Are you scared?

358
00:15:52,399 --> 00:15:53,088
Speak!

359
00:15:54,679 --> 00:15:55,639
Who is your accomplice?

360
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:57,559
Speak!

361
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,279
Who is it?

362
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:07,159
(I can't say.)

363
00:16:07,519 --> 00:16:08,840
(However powerful a loong is,)

364
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,639
(he's vulnerable to human schemes.)

365
00:16:11,279 --> 00:16:12,159
(His identity)

366
00:16:12,679 --> 00:16:15,759
(must never be revealed.)

367
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,159
Stop it.

368
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:20,799
Scared now?

369
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:22,759
Too late.

370
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,440
I only fear

371
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:26,759
when the time comes,

372
00:16:26,759 --> 00:16:29,080
you won't even
have the chance to regret it.

373
00:16:45,159 --> 00:16:47,559
It seems she won't talk,
even if it kills her.

374
00:16:54,519 --> 00:16:56,360
Then make her press her mark.

375
00:17:07,712 --> 00:17:12,287
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

376
00:17:13,062 --> 00:17:17,559
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

377
00:17:20,798 --> 00:17:25,920
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

378
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:29,259
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

379
00:17:29,259 --> 00:17:30,623
♪Refusing to forget♪

380
00:17:34,289 --> 00:17:39,066
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

381
00:17:39,617 --> 00:17:41,407
♪He cannot learn them♪

382
00:17:41,407 --> 00:17:44,542
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

383
00:17:47,694 --> 00:17:50,018
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

384
00:17:50,018 --> 00:17:52,381
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

385
00:17:52,959 --> 00:17:55,623
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

386
00:17:55,623 --> 00:17:57,381
♪Their days ahead are long♪
